      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1774172933117,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- When messages are recieved\nby all the clients, as it's being\ndeleted from the inbox,\nit can also be deleted from the \nMessages table.\n- This process of identifying might face race conditions.\nbut we have guardrails of 30 days anyways, so we don't need to worry about the race\nconditions that much.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- When messages are recieved\nby all the clients, as it's being\ndeleted from the inbox,\nit can also be deleted from the \nMessages table.\n- This process of identifying might face race conditions.\nbut we have guardrails of 30 days anyways, so we don't need to worry about the race\nconditions that much.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
