      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1774173753318,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "inbox will have clientId. redis pubsub will now have topic per client.\n- will need to put a limit on number of devices.\n- also extend it to the transaction write for every new message, to Messages and Inbox table.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "inbox will have clientId. redis pubsub will now have topic per client.\n- will need to put a limit on number of devices.\n- also extend it to the transaction write for every new message, to Messages and Inbox table.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
