      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Can just maintain availability table, the chatserver writes to it when a connections is established, and again when it's terminated.\n- Major issues can come up when the expectation is to send out a notifications when someone's status changes. THis can results in\n  some serious fanout. so, we need to put limitation on how many users can watch another user.",
